  {
    q: 'How much does shipping from China to Portugal cost?',
    a: 'The published Iberian corridor reference is $1,300–$5,000 for a 20ft, $1,800–$7,000 for a 40ft and $70–$170 per CBM for LCL (all MEDIUM confidence, Valencia reference) — Sines-, Lisbon- and Leixões-specific figures are not published and must be requested. On the FCL/LCL split the planning break-even sits near 15 CBM: below that LCL is usually cheaper, above it FCL starts to win.',
