  {
    q: 'What is the VAT rate in Portugal?',
    a: 'Portugal applies a 23% standard VAT rate, with reduced rates of 13% and 6% on some goods. Import VAT is charged on the duty-inclusive value, so 5% duty plus 23% VAT compounds to ×1.2915, not 28% — a $10,000 CIF shipment at 5% duty lands at $12,915, not the $12,800 a simple sum of the two rates would give.',
