      <h2>2. Indicative freight rates from China to Portugal</h2>
      <p>
        Portugal inherits the published <strong>Valencia Iberian corridor benchmark</strong> from the
        WorldFreightHub Europe route data, and it is important to read those figures for what they are — a
        corridor reference, not a Portuguese rate. The snapshot carries <strong>$1,300–$5,000 for a
        20ft</strong>, <strong>$1,800–$7,000 for a 40ft</strong> and <strong>$70–$170 per CBM for
        LCL</strong>, all MEDIUM confidence. Sines-, Lisbon- and Leixões-specific figures are
        <strong>not published</strong>, and rail, air, express and DDP were also not published in the
        snapshot, so those stay LOW with a request-for-quote marker.
      </p>

